DreamUIDynamicSpriteAtlasData:RenderSpriteArray {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIDynamicSpriteAtlasData.h#DreamUIDynamicSpriteAtlasData:RenderSpriteArray
    src   "collection of all objects that use this atlas to render. Object must implement IUISpriteRenderableInterface."
